  "releaseNotes": "Added explicit structured matrix extraction APIs with separate view and copy operations, including sized overloads for directly extracting diagonal, triangular, symmetric, and Hermitian results.\nAdded MRG32k3a random number generator support, including classic RngStreams-style stream and substream handling.",
